us at the Emerging Technology Forum. This is a unique and exclusive gathering of 
business leaders who meet to share knowledge and expertise on strategic 
technology issues.  

We hosted the Forum in 1993 and 1994 and are reinstating it this year at the urging 
of our past participants, including the CTO's and CIO's of major multinational firms.  
These members asked us to provide this as a platform to explore technology issues 
in a vendor-free environment, with an emphasis on brainstorming and networking.  
