> Does anyone run cmu's snmpget, snmptest, snmpwalk on an Alpha?
> I compiled the source, but the snmp requests are somehow malformed
> and I'd just as soon grab healthy binaries than debug this.

Funny, I just compiled the sucker yesterday!  What you have
to do is edit every file and change the string 'long' to 'int',
