Yes, there is a solution:

Boot up to single user mode and do:

# date
Wed Dec 31 xx:xx:xx MET DST 2025
# date [[yy[mm[dd]]]hhmm[.ss][-tttt][z]]

eg: date 9609071400

# mount -u /       --> writes date info into superblock

# init 3           --> boot to multi-user mode

see man-page 'date'


Jelle




